@ref s 5(3A)(c) (src:481-484)
GIVEN `the contract is for betting that takes place on a totalisator conducted by or on behalf of the Singapore Totalisator Board or a turf club in accordance with an approved scheme` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 5(3A)(c) the contract for betting on a totalisator is within the exception` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the contract is for betting that takes place on a totalisator conducted by or on behalf of the Singapore Totalisator Board or a turf club in accordance with an approved scheme` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a contract for betting that takes place on a totalisator conducted by or on behalf of the Singapore Totalisator Board or a turf club in accordance with an approved scheme"

-- src:488 | (d) a contract to participate in a private lottery promoted or
